			"Message": "fix(Rest): Correct path separator logic in VS Code compatibility test\n\nUpdate the file exclusion logic in `tests/integration/vscode_compatibility.rs` to properly detect Windows-style paths. The previous regex check for `\\test\\` was accidentally corrupted into a tab character (`\\test\\`) during a prior edit, causing the filter to fail on Windows-style directory structures.\n\nAdditionally, update the `README.md` to remove unnecessary HTML entities (`&#x2001;`) from the \"Funding & Acknowledgements\" header for cleaner rendering, and update the `Documentation/Rust` submodule to the latest revision which includes the generated search index for the API documentation. The `bin/Rest` binary is updated to reflect the current build state.",
